mutation dispatch an already expired alarm
detects ExpiryGate
-     /\ LET network == now < At(k)+Grace
+     /\ LET network == now <= At(k)+Grace

mutation skip the deadline recheck after awaiting VAPID keys
detects ExpiryGate
-     /\ LET network == now < At(k)+Grace
+     /\ LET network == TRUE

mutation permit a retry exactly at the expiry deadline
detects RetryOnlyBeforeDeadline
-     /\ LET retry == result = "temp" /\ now+1 < At(item)+Grace
+     /\ LET retry == result = "temp" /\ now+1 <= At(item)+Grace

mutation retry a permanent request error
detects RetryOnlyBeforeDeadline
-     /\ LET retry == result = "temp" /\ now+1 < At(item)+Grace
+     /\ LET retry == result \in {"temp","permanent"} /\ now+1 < At(item)+Grace

mutation discard the later departure reminder when consuming the ready reminder
detects PreserveOtherReminder
-                    ELSE [q EXCEPT ![item] = IF retry THEN now+1 ELSE 0]
+                    ELSE [None EXCEPT ![item] = IF retry THEN now+1 ELSE 0]

mutation retain the other pending reminder for an invalidated subscription
detects GoneClosesDevice
-            next == IF result = "gone" THEN None
+            next == IF result = "gone" THEN [q EXCEPT ![item] = 0]

mutation add an acknowledged delivery to the future queue
detects NoRequeueAfterCommit
-                    ELSE [q EXCEPT ![item] = IF retry THEN now+1 ELSE 0]
+                    ELSE [q EXCEPT ![item] = IF retry \/ result = "ok" THEN now+1 ELSE 0]
